MESSAGE(MENU, "============================================================\r\n  Liner notes — RTBBS-style menu\r\n============================================================\r\n [Read and search]\r\n  B Select board       F File vault       P Profiles\r\n  L User log     U Member list      S System information\r\n [Communication and mail]\r\n  M Mail         C Chat             T Private talk\r\n  G Gather       W Online           D Call SYSOP\r\n  \\ Memo         # Account          SYSOPMAIL title\r\n [Write and settings]\r\n  E Shared editor I Settings        A Register / apply\r\n  LOGIN name / LOGOUT / PASSWD / ACCOUNT\r\n  CHECK ARTICLES / MAIL / FILES     New since last check\r\n  LANG JA|EN / PAGER ON|OFF / MENUMODE BEGINNER|STANDARD|EXPERT\r\n  GAMES / DOOR id                   Native games\r\n [Help and exit]\r\n  H HELP         ? Redisplay menu   V Version\r\n  O / Q Disconnect                  MENU Main screen\r\n[ADMIN_MENU]\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  First visit: A register, B boards, number select, E post.\r\n  Shortcuts depend on the current screen. Named commands remain available.\r\n  Lowercase is accepted. /CANCEL cancels an input prompt.\r\n  CHAT / MAIL / VAULT / GATHER / ONLINE  Named commands also work\r\n")
