MESSAGE(EDIT, "/HELP for editor help.\r\n\r\nEnter the body (up to 262144 bytes including line endings).\r\nA line containing only . saves / /CANCEL cancels\r\nAdd an extra . to lines beginning with a dot.\r\n /PREVIEW shows the unsaved draft. Use //PREVIEW for a literal line.\r\n/LINES lists line numbers. /TITLE title, /REPLACE number text, /DELETE number.\r\n/INSERT number text inserts a line; /UNDO reverts one edit.\r\n/SAVE stores a member draft. Use //SAVE for a literal line.\r\n")
