MESSAGE(MENU_SIGOP, " [Board SIGOP] HIDE / RESTORE / INSPECT / RETITLE / BOARDINFO / BOARDSET / BOARDLOG / AUDIT\r\n  BOARDOPTIONS / BOARDPASS / INFOEDIT / BOARDACCESS\r\n  AUTHOR / BOARDGUEST\r\n")
MESSAGE(HELP_SIGOP_LINK, "HELP SIGOP Board management\r\n")
MESSAGE(HELP_SIGOP, "SIGOP rights apply to the assigned board and descendants. SIGOPS lists the scope.\r\nBOARDSET may create children and change settings inside that scope. SIGOP board member|NONE appoints subordinate moderators, never the actor's own assignment or an unrelated board. Reparenting requires management rights at both the original board and destination parent.\r\nSelect BOARD, then HIDE / RESTORE / INSPECT / RETITLE / WITHDRAW / AUDIT / BOARDOPTIONS / BOARDPASS / INFOEDIT / BOARDACCESS / AUTHOR / BOARDGUEST.\r\nGROUP member group / UNGROUP manages groups named in the current managed board's read/write rules; SIGOPGROUP delegation is no longer required. Unrelated groups and protected administrators cannot be changed.\r\nBoard deletion, article moves and global member-level changes remain administrator operations.\r\nFile SIGOPs inherit parent paths. FILEBOARDSET configures descendants and FILEBOARDSIGOP appoints subordinate moderators. FILECOPY / BATCH COPY requires management rights at both ends. No self-promotion.\r\n")
