MESSAGE(HELP_ADMINMEMBERS, "Members and applications\r\nMEMBERS / MEMBER id / RIGHTS id\r\nAPPLICATIONS / APPLICATION id / APPLICATIONSET id field value / APPROVE id\r\nREJECT id CONFIRM / DELETEAPPLICATION id CONFIRM\r\nSUSPEND id / RESUME id / DELETEUSER id CONFIRM\r\nRESETPASS id: hidden password entry\r\nLEVEL id 0..5 / GROUP or UNGROUP id 1..100 / GROUPMOVE source destination CONFIRM\r\nMEMBERPROFILE id field value\r\nLevel 5 alone does not grant administrator rights. IDs and login names are never reused.\r\n")
MESSAGE(HELP_ADMINBOARDS, "Board administration\r\nBOARDINFO id / BOARDSET id|parent|read|write|title|description\r\nBOARDOPTIONS id BOARD|MENU order article-limit body-byte-limit access-log-limit\r\nBOARDPASS id / BOARDPASS id NONE CONFIRM / INFOEDIT id\r\nSIGOP board member|NONE / SIGOPS / SIGOPGROUP board group\r\nBOARDGROUP board old-group new-group CONFIRM / BOARDGUEST board ON|OFF\r\nWITHDRAW article CONFIRM: author, administrator or inherited SIGOP\r\nHIDE / RESTORE / INSPECT article: moderation distinct from withdrawal\r\nRETITLE article title / AUTHOR article member CONFIRM\r\nMOVE root destination CONFIRM / MOVEBRANCH article destination CONFIRM\r\nBOARDDELETE board CONFIRM / BOARDDELETEALL board CASCADE CONFIRM\r\nBOARDLOG / BOARDACCESS board / AUDIT ARTICLE article\r\n")
MESSAGE(HELP_ADMINFILES, "Vault administration\r\nFILEBOARDINFO path / FILEBOARDSET path|read|upload (root: -)\r\nFILEBOARDNAME path|name / FILEINFOEDIT path / FILEBOARDSIGOP path|member or NONE\r\nFILEBOARDPASS path / FILEBOARDPASS path NONE CONFIRM\r\nFILEBOARDOPTIONS path|BOARD or MENU order download-log-retention\r\nFILEOWNER file member / FILERENAME file name / FILEASCII file ON|OFF\r\nFILECATEGORY file path / FILEDESC file description\r\nFILEHIDE file CONFIRM / FILERESTORE file CONFIRM / FILEDELETE file CONFIRM\r\nFILEDELETE reclaims the physical payload. FILEAUDIT / FILEHISTORY / FILESTATS report events and counts.\r\nInherited SIGOP rights apply only within scope. Private mail attachment permissions are unchanged.\r\n")
MESSAGE(HELP_ADMINCONNECTIONS, "Connections, announcements and shutdown\r\nCONNECTIONS: all connections, transport, activity, elapsed/idle time and traffic\r\nDISCONNECT connection CONFIRM / ANNOUNCE text\r\nSHUTDOWN seconds reason (1..86400) / SHUTDOWN CANCEL / SHUTDOWN NOW CONFIRM\r\nIn chat: /KICK login\r\nUSERLOG ALL / USERSTATS ALL\r\n")
MESSAGE(HELP_ADMINSTORAGE, "History and offline maintenance\r\nAUDIT / AUDIT ARTICLE id / AUDIT ACTOR login / AUDIT ACTORID id\r\nAUDIT REFRESH / AUDIT ALL / + for next page\r\nBOARDLOG / BOARDACCESS board / FILEAUDIT / FILEHISTORY\r\nWithdrawal, retitling and author changes retain the operator identity.\r\nStop the BBS and transfer workers before running liner-notes-admin.\r\nSQLite: db-backup / verify / db-restore / db-compact\r\nMigration: db-migrate. Portable export: db-export.\r\nUse db-compact --reclaim-withdrawn to remove withdrawn bodies in a new copy.\r\n--all-stores also compacts other stores. Backups are retained. See STAGE67.md for arguments.\r\n")
MESSAGE(CLASSIC_ADMIN_MENU, "Administration\r\n 1 Members and applications / 2 Boards / 3 File vault\r\n 4 Connections, announcements and shutdown / 5 History and maintenance\r\n 0 Main / ? Menu\r\n")
MESSAGE(CLASSIC_SIGOP_MENU, "SIGOP board administration\r\n 1 Scoped operation guide / 0 Main\r\n WITHDRAW / RETITLE / AUTHOR / BOARDINFO / INFOEDIT\r\n SIGOPS / GROUP / UNGROUP / HELP SIGOP\r\n")
